# Tidewatch Cape -- coastal route, 32x14 (buffer 760/1300), ref OlivineCity
# HOOK: a sandy shore route that ends at a small beacon lighthouse on a rocky cape.
#   Land players walk the top; Surfers get a second layer of the route offshore.
# LAYOUT (W to E): a dune path (row 3) runs under the tree line. A path ledge (56)
#   along the dune is a one-way drop onto the beach. The beach holds two tide pools
#   (54 76 55/58 35 59 and a 54 55 one-row pool) with boulders (0a). A sheltered bay
#   has a long a3 pier and a surf shack (96 97/9a 9b) at its head. The cape has a
#   4-block lighthouse (08 09/7e 7f/13 0f/1a 11, Olivine's tower cut short) and
#   rock outcrops that taper to a tip. Offshore are a reef line (31), a reef ring
#   (30 31 31 32/38 39 39 3a) and a sand islet.
# BEATS: Picnicker under the dune ledge watching the beach; Fisher at the tide pool
#   (pool fishing = Krabby/Shellder/Corsola table); Fisher at the pier tip; Sailor
#   on the cape facing the beacon path; SwimmerF by the reef, SwimmerM in the bay
#   mouth. BeaconKeeper (story/heal-for-money NPC per no-PC notes). SurferDude at
#   the shack (Surf hint or tutor). Items: grass pocket item, tide-pool hidden,
#   cape-tip hidden, islet item (Surf).
# ATTACH: W -> Olivine's south-west / Route 40 shore (beach continues off-map at
#   rows 3-8); E -> stub (future town or Route 41 coast). Surf can also leave by the
#   south/east sea edges if a sea map is attached. Indoors: beacon, shack.
# TILE GAPS: no sand tile (01 path is Johto's sand); no bottom shore piece, so the
#   sea meets the sand flush (as in Cianwood and Route 40).
ref OlivineCity
key P=a3 r=31 Q=30 R=32 z=38 Z=39 x=3a k=34 K=36
key D=96 E=97 F=9a G=9b
key 1=08 2=09 3=7e 4=7f 5=13 6=0f 7=1a 8=11
grid:
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TTTTTTTTT,""",TTTTTTTT..12..TTTT
TTTT,,,,,,""",,,DETTT,..34.o,TTT
........,,,,,...FG.,,,..56......
.________..o............78......
..........o.~~~~P~~~~........~~~
.(^).().....~~~~P~~~~~......~~~~
.[~]o.....o.~~~~P~~~~~o....o~~~~
............~~~~P~~~~~~....~~~~~
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~o.~~~~~~
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~.o~~~
rrrrrrr~~~QrrR~~~~~~~~~~~~..~~~~
~~~~~~~~~~zZZx~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
end
